# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIBERATELY NOT IGNORED — these are how the submission is audited:
#
#   results.json            the deliverable itself
#   tests/                  including golden_capital_chain.json (the oracle)
#   DISCOVERY.md            the reasoning trail
#   CLAUDE.md               the working rules
#   archean/                all pipeline source
#   scripts/                investigation tools used to reach the conclusions
#   docs/box_checks/*.png   rendered bbox proofs (small, and they are evidence)
#
#   cache/llm/              NOT ignored on purpose. Committing the cached LLM
#                           responses is what lets a reviewer reproduce
#                           results.json with no API key. See CLAUDE.md.
